  <string name="pages_reset_confirm">Reset layout order and enabled pairs?</string>
  <string name="pages_explanation">Fn switches only between a layout and its paired variant. Edit the variant to change its keys. Swipe southeast on Enter for the chooser. Space up/down cycles enabled layouts. Double tap or long press Shift locks capitals. Previous arbitrary Fn targets are backed up and retired.</string>
  <string name="page_save">Save</string>
  <string name="page_changed_elsewhere">Layout settings changed while editing. Reopen the editor before saving.</string>
  <string name="page_shift_preview">Preview and edit Shift layer</string>
  <string name="page_dynamic_controls">This layout displays dynamic content. Its control row appears here. Enter southeast opens the chooser. Shared Space, arrows, Enter and deletion positions are fixed across layouts.</string>
  <string name="page_editor_help">Tap a key, then choose its center or swipe direction. Changes take effect after Save. Shared controls are shown but cannot be changed independently in this editor. Legacy overrides for these positions remain in the backup.</string>
