  <string name="page_zhuyin">Zhuyin text</string>
  <string name="page_phonetic_help">Chinese Space NW opens Pinyin text, or Zhuyin text as configured above. Selecting an entry enables that layout; disabling it hides the shortcut. Shift NE in phonetic layouts returns to Chinese. Space NW within Pinyin or Zhuyin opens finals; finals Space NW is Backspace. Space up/down always cycles layouts. Vowel/final corners: NW first, NE second, SW third, SE fourth tone; center is unmarked.</string>
