  <string name="symbol_panel_help">Symbols: tap a category to return to its first page. Space NW/NE goes to the previous/next page in that category; up/down still cycles layouts. Shift toggles explicit full/half-width pairs. Symbols without a width pair stay unchanged. Fn has no special effect.</string>
